WIP kernel for the T-Mobile Revvl 6 Pro/T-Phone Pro 2023

(may not reflect current commit and your device)

What works:
Battery gauge
GPU
CPU
Most of the sensors
Side buttons
Hardware decoding
Hardware encoding
Display (BOE panel not tested.)
Touchscreen
Modem (SMS isn't tested but it may work given mobile data and phone calls work)
Audio

What partially works:
USB (OTG doesn't work)

What doesn't:
SD Cards
Side fingerprint scanner
Camera
Connectivity (Wi-Fi, Bluetooth)
NFC

